OL,3,CFootage shows rat scurrying through
OL,4,Chospital corridor
OL,6,FA rat has been spotted scurrying
OL,7,Fthrough the corridor of a hospital in
OL,8,Fsouth Wales.
OL,10,FThe video, sent to ITV Cymru Wales,
OL,11,Fshows a rodent at the Royal Glamorgan
OL,12,FHospital near Pontyclun. The animal
OL,13,Fcan be seen running along the corridor
OL,14,Fas a person follows it.
OL,16,FThe hospital is a district general
OL,17,Fhospital in Ynysmaerdy, Rhondda Cynon
OL,18,FTaf. It is managed by the Cwm Taf
OL,19,FMorgannwg University Health Board, and
OL,20,Ftreats NHS Wales patients.
