OL,3,CFootage shows rat scurrying through
OL,4,Chospital corridor
OL,6,FIn a statement the health board said:
OL,7,F''Immediate inspections of the
OL,8,Fhospital and surrounding areas were
OL,9,Fundertaken by our pest control
OL,10,Fcontractor and Facilities teams.
OL,12,F"No evidence of rodent activity was
OL,13,Fidentified during these inspections.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
