OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786043913
OL,3,CFootage shows rat scurrying through
OL,4,Chospital corridor
OL,6,F"As a precaution, additional
OL,7,Fmonitoring stations have been
OL,8,Finstalled in external areas and
OL,9,Ffurther inspections will be carried
OL,10,Fout by our pest control contractor. We
OL,11,Fhave also reinforced the importance of
OL,12,Fkeeping doors and windows closed where
OL,13,Fappropriate.
OL,15,F"We would like to reassure patients
OL,16,Fand the public that there is currently
OL,17,Fno evidence of an ongoing issue within
OL,18,Fthe hospital. We have robust pest
OL,19,Fmanagement measures in place and will
OL,20,Fcontinue to monitor the situation
OL,21,Fclosely."
